    "text": "This is a greedy, event-driven scheduler. It never moves services or creates binaries, which keeps every output valid but gives up any gain those moves could bring.\n\n**Approach**\n\n1. **Work units.** For each feature, the binaries it must be implemented in are found from its services' initial binaries. Each (feature, binary) pair is one implementation task.\n\n2. **Feature ordering.** Each feature gets a sort key. `W` is the total work: the sum over its binaries of D + R_B. `mx` is the longest single task: D + max R_B. Several keys are tried, and each ordering is fully simulated. The one with the highest score is output.\n   - `U/W^a` for `a` in {0.5, 1, 1.5, 2}\n   - `U/mx`\n   - `U\u00b7(L\u2212mx)/W`\n\n3. **Simulation.**\n   - **Event order.** Engineers are handled in a priority queue ordered by (free time, engineer index). Ties on the same day go in submission-file order, which is exactly how the statement resolves C_B for same-day starts.\n   - **C_B tracking.** All tasks finishing on or before day t are released before anything starts on day t. This keeps C_B (engineers active on that binary) exact.\n   - **Picking work.** A free engineer first takes a pending pair from features already started. Otherwise the next feature in the ordering is started, if its longest task can still finish before L.\n   - **Abandoning features.** If a pair cannot finish before L, its feature is marked dead and its remaining pairs are skipped.\n\n4. **Validity.**\n   - Each (feature, binary) pair is assigned to only one engineer.\n   - Every scheduled task finishes before L, and each lasts at least one day, so each engineer has at most L tasks.\n   - Engineers start their next task the moment the previous one ends, so no `wait` tasks are needed.\n   - Engineers with no tasks are left out, which keeps every listed block at T \u2265 1.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint L,G,S,B,F,N;\nvector<string> sname, fname;\nvector<int> sbin;\nvector<int> FD, FU;\nvector<vector<int>> fb; // binaries per feature\nvector<int> R;\n\nlong long simulate(const vector<int>& order, bool record, vector<vector<pair<int,int>>>* out){\n    vector<char> dead(F,0);\n    vector<int> fin(F,0), rem(F,0);\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++) rem[f]=(int)fb[f].size();\n    vector<int> active(B,0);\n    priority_queue<pair<int,int>,vector<pair<int,int>>,greater<pair<int,int>>> eq, fq;\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++) eq.push({0,i});\n    deque<pair<int,int>> pending;\n    size_t ptr=0;\n    while(!eq.empty()){\n        auto [t,e]=eq.top(); eq.pop();\n        while(!fq.empty() && fq.top().first<=t){ active[fq.top().second]--; fq.pop(); }\n        while(true){\n            while(pending.empty() && ptr<order.size()){\n                int f=order[ptr++];\n                int worst=0;\n                for(int b:fb[f]) worst=max(worst,FD[f]+R[b]+active[b]);\n                if((long long)t+worst<L){\n                    for(int b:fb[f]) pending.push_back({f,b});\n                }\n            }\n            if(pending.empty()) break;\n            auto [f,b]=pending.front(); pending.pop_front();\n            if(dead[f]) continue;\n            int d=FD[f]+R[b]+active[b];\n            if((long long)t+d>=L){ dead[f]=1; continue; }\n            active[b]++;\n            fq.push({t+d,b});\n            fin[f]=max(fin[f],t+d);\n            rem[f]--;\n            if(record) (*out)[e].push_back({f,b});\n            eq.push({t+d,e});\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n    long long sc=0;\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++) if(!dead[f]&&rem[f]==0&&fin[f]<L) sc+=(long long)FU[f]*(L-fin[f]);\n    return sc;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    ios::sync_with_stdio(false);cin.tie(nullptr);\n    cin>>L>>G>>S>>B>>F>>N;\n    sname.resize(S); sbin.resize(S);\n    unordered_map<string,int> sid; sid.reserve(S*2);\n    R.assign(B,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<S;i++){cin>>sname[i]>>sbin[i]; sid[sname[i]]=i; R[sbin[i]]++;}\n    fname.resize(F); FD.resize(F); FU.resize(F); fb.resize(F);\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n        int M; cin>>fname[f]>>M>>FD[f]>>FU[f];\n        vector<int> bs;\n        for(int j=0;j<M;j++){string s;cin>>s; auto it=sid.find(s); if(it!=sid.end()) bs.push_back(sbin[it->second]);}\n        sort(bs.begin(),bs.end()); bs.erase(unique(bs.begin(),bs.end()),bs.end());\n        fb[f]=bs;\n    }\n    vector<double> W(F), MX(F);\n    for(int f=0;f<F;f++){\n        double w=0,m=0;\n        for(int b:fb[f]){w+=FD[f]+R[b]; m=max(m,(double)FD[f]+R[b]);}\n        W[f]=max(w,1.0); MX[f]=max(m,1.0);\n    }\n    vector<vector<double>> keys;\n    for(double a:{0.5,1.0,1.5,2.0}){\n        vector<double> k(F); for(int f=0;f<F;f++) k[f]=FU[f]/pow(W[f],a); keys.push_back(k);\n    }\n    {vector<double> k(F); for(int f=0;f<F;f++) k[f]=FU[f]/MX[f]; keys.push_back(k);}\n    {vector<double> k(F); for(int f=0;f<F;f++) k[f]=FU[f]*max(0.0,L-MX[f])/W[f]; keys.push_back(k);}\n    long long best=-1; vector<int> bestOrder;\n    for(auto&k:keys){\n        vector<int> ord;\n        for(int f=0;f<F;f++) if(!fb[f].empty()) ord.push_back(f);\n        stable_sort(ord.begin(),ord.end(),[&](int a,int b){return k[a]>k[b];});\n        long long sc=simulate(ord,false,nullptr);\n        if(sc>best){best=sc;bestOrder=ord;}\n    }\n    vector<vector<pair<int,int>>> out(G);\n    simulate(bestOrder,true,&out);\n    int E=0; for(int i=0;i<G;i++) if(!out[i].empty()) E++;\n    string res; res.reserve(1<<20);\n    res+=to_string(E)+\"\\n\";\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++){\n        if(out[i].empty()) continue;\n        res+=to_string(out[i].size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(auto&p:out[i]){ res+=\"impl \"; res+=fname[p.first]; res+=\" \"; res+=to_string(p.second); res+=\"\\n\"; }\n    }\n    fwrite(res.data(),1,res.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
